# Copy to .env at the repository root and fill in.
#
# There is no LLM API key. Models run locally through Ollama, so the only settings here
# are addresses and overrides -- none of them secret, all of them optional.

# Contact address for OpenAlex's polite pool. Not a secret; a real address gets you
# faster service and is the courteous thing to send.
# OPENALEX_MAILTO=you@example.ac.uk

# Local model server and the model to use.
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
# ACV_OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3:4b
# ACV_EXTRACT_MODEL=qwen3:4b

# Per-agent override, e.g. point one agent at a larger local model:
# ACV_AGENT_PROVIDERS=critic=ollama
# ACV_AGENT_MODEL=

# SIESTA binary and MPI, if not on the usual paths.
# ACV_SIESTA_BIN=
# ACV_MPIRUN=
# ACV_LOCAL_RANKS=6

# Prefix under which setup/ installs SIESTA and micromamba (default: $HOME/opt).
# ACV_OPT_PREFIX=

# KV cache precision for the model server. q4_0 is what the manuscript used and is the
# default; f16 is more stable but gives DIFFERENT numbers. See AZURE_SETUP.md.
# KV_CACHE=q4_0
